{'symbol': 'FISV', 'date': '2023-02-01 13:48:00', 'title': "FISERV NAMED A WORLD'S MOST ADMIRED COMPANY FOR 2023", 'text': "BROOKFIELD, WIS.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--FISERV, INC. (NASDAQ: FISV), A LEADING GLOBAL PROVIDER OF PAYMENTS AND FINANCIAL SERVICES TECHNOLOGY SOLUTIONS, HAS BEEN NAMED ONE OF FORTUNE® “WORLD'S MOST ADMIRED COMPANIES™” FOR 2023. THIS PRESTIGIOUS ANNUAL RANKING IDENTIFIES THE ORGANIZATIONS WITH THE STRONGEST REPUTATIONS WITHIN THEIR INDUSTRIES AND ACROSS INDUSTRY SECTORS."}